```Title: Network Configuration Discovery Commands (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1016 | Severity: low | Sigma id: 00f5040b-c751-46ff-95f6-1c8d6cc4479b```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Users, help desk and administrators troubleshooting networks```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity low.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
((Image="*\\ipconfig.exe" CommandLine="*/all*") OR (Image="*\\route.exe" CommandLine="*print*") OR (Image="*\\arp.exe" CommandLine="*-a*") OR (Image="*\\netsh.exe" CommandLine="*interface*" CommandLine="*show*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
